    note right of pending
        Google and Apple sign-up no longer return a result to Base:
        Auth finalizes the registration (adr/sign-up-finalization-in-auth.md).
        Provider browser state, email and display name never resolve
        an actor; only verified issuer and subject are authoritative.
        Release history prevents stale callback reattachment.
        App link completion requires a live pending Ticket grant and
        retires that grant after consuming the candidate.
        A verified Google/Apple login callback may expose only the closed
        L1/L2 subject reason matching its admitted entry. The 400 guidance
        clears Auth continuity and links to a fresh Base /sign request with
        normalized ri only; it never reuses provider state or evidence.
        Unverified callbacks and every other refusal keep the generic response.
    end note
